460	// `mysql_oracle` → Oracle MySQL server (installed when the source runs Oracle MySQL,
461	//                  so the restore is a clean same-engine import). Every package
462	//                  string below is a compile-time constant; the CHOICE between keys
463	//                  comes from a validated detected enum, never a source-supplied string.
